    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StD, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0LD_1RC1RA_1LD0RD_0RA1LC [SCycL 2 0; SWin 6; SCycR 4; SWinR 1] (StD, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
