Module LAPT_1RB0LD_1RC1RA_1LD1RA_0RC1LD.
(** * LAPT_1RB0LD_1RC1RA_1LD1RA_0RC1LD: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0LD_1RC1RA_1LD1RA_0RC1LD, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

