Module LAPT_1RB0LD_1RC1RA_1LD____0RB1LD.
(** * LAPT_1RB0LD_1RC1RA_1LD____0RB1LD: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0LD_1RC1RA_1LD---_0RB1LD, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

