Module LAPT_1RB0LD_1RC1RB_1LD1RC_0RB1LA.
(** * LAPT_1RB0LD_1RC1RB_1LD1RC_0RB1LA: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0LD_1RC1RB_1LD1RC_0RB1LA, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

