    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StA, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0LD_1RC____1LA1RA_0RB0LD [SCycL 3 0; SWin 2; SWinL 3] (StA, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
