    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0RA_0LC0RB_1RA0LD_1LC0RA p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0RA_0LC0RB_1RA0LD_1LC0RA p j' E).
