    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0RA_0LC1RA_0RB0LD_1LC1LD p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0RA_0LC1RA_0RB0LD_1LC1LD p j' E).
    + lia.
