    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StD, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0RA_0LC1RA_0RB0LD_1LC1LD [SCycL 2 0; SWin 2; SWinL 4; SCycR 2; SWinR 4] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

