    + exact run_ovf_1RB0RA_0LC1RA_1RA0LD_1LC0RA.
    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0RA_0LC1RA_1RA0LD_1LC0RA p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0RA_0LC1RA_1RA0LD_1LC0RA p j' E).
    + lia.
