Module LAPT_1RB0RA_0RC0LA_1LD0RC_0LD1LA.
(** * LAPT_1RB0RA_0RC0LA_1LD0RC_0LD1LA: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0RA_0RC0LA_1LD0RC_0LD1LA, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

